    "caption": "⚡️ We are inviting you to the Remote class from GitHub for Startups.\n\nDiscover how to:\n🔹 Create a fully configured cloud-based development environment to eliminate the developer onboarding process;\n🔹 Use an AI pair programmer to streamline coding, keeping your developers in the zone.\n\nDeveloper velocity is the trendy buzzword today, focused around how to ensure our teams are able to do their best work as efficiently as possible. There are numerous roadblocks, from setup requirements to repetitive code to developers unable to focus on real problems. With Codespaces and Copilot, you can free your developers from these struggles and allow them to really shine. \n\n❗️For more information go to the profile description (taplink).",
